{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "ISA",
  "chapter": 33,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Woe to thee that layest waste, and thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "wast",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not laid waste; and dealest treacherously, and they dealt not treacherously with thee! when thou shalt cease to lay waste, thou shalt be wasted; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " when thou shalt make an end to deal treacherously, they shall deal treacherously with thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O LORD, be gracious to us; we have waited for thee: be thou their arm every morning, our salvation also in the time of trouble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "At the noise of the tumult the people fled; at the lifting up of thyself the nations were scattered.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And your spoil shall be gathered ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the gathering of the caterpillar: as the running to and fro of locusts shall he run upon them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD is exalted; for he dwelleth on high: he hath filled Zion with judgment and righteousness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And wisdom and knowledge shall be the stability of thy times, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " strength of salvation: the fear of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his treasure.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, their valiant ones shall cry without: the embassadors of peace shall weep bitterly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The highways lie waste, the way-faring man ceaseth: he hath broken the covenant, he hath despised the cities, he regardeth no man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The earth mourneth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " languisheth: Lebanon is ashamed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hewn down: Sharon is like a wilderness; and Bashan and Carmel shake off ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their fruits",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now will I rise, saith the LORD; now will I be exalted; now will I lift up myself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye shall conceive chaff, ye shall bring forth stubble: your breath, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fire, shall devour you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the people shall be ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the burnings of lime: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thorns cut up shall they be burned in the fire.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " far off, hear what I have done; and ye ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " near, acknowledge my might.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sinners in Zion are afraid; fearfulness hath surprised the hypocrites. Who among us shall dwell with the devouring fire? who among us shall dwell with everlasting burnings?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that walketh righteously, and speaketh uprightly; he that despiseth the gain of oppressions, that shaketh his hands from holding of bribes, that stoppeth his ears from hearing of blood, and shutteth his eyes from seeing evil;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He shall dwell on high: his place of defense ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the munitions of rocks: bread shall be given him; his waters ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sure.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy eyes shall see the king in his beauty: they shall behold the land that is very far off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy heart shall meditate terror. Where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the scribe? where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the receiver? where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that counted the towers?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not see a fierce people, a people of deeper speech than thou canst perceive; of a stammering tongue, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that thou canst",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not understand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Look upon Zion, the city of our solemnities: thy eyes shall see Jerusalem a quiet habitation, a tabernacle ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall not be taken down; not one of its stakes shall ever be removed, neither shall any of its cords be broken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But there the glorious LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "will be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to us a place of broad rivers ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " streams; in which shall go no galley with oars, neither shall gallant ship pass through it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " our judge, the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " our lawgiver, the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " our king; he will save us.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy tacklings are loosed; they could not well strengthen their mast, they could not spread the sail: then is the prey of a great spoil divided; the lame take the prey.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.33.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.33.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the inhabitants shall not say, I am sick: the people that dwell therein ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " forgiven ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " iniquity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
